# Frontend Architecture

Read `frontend/AGENTS.md`. Stack: React, Vite, Tailwind, Zustand, TanStack Query, Recharts, `lucide-react`, Clerk.

## State

Server data lives in TanStack Query. Zustand holds UI state only. Do not copy opportunities or signals into a store.

## API

One client module per resource. Paths and types match `docs/API_CONTRACT.md`. Attach the Clerk bearer token there, not in components.

```tsx
// BAD — invented field, server data copied into the store
store.setScore(data.score_value)

// GOOD — contract field, query is the source of truth
const { data, isLoading, error } = useQuery({
  queryKey: ['opportunity', id],
  queryFn: () => getOpportunity(id),
})
```

A 401 returns the user to `/login`. A 403 for a missing role shows the no-role page.

## Components

Use the names in `docs/UI_UX_DESIGN.md` §40. Reuse them. Do not create a second score badge or evidence card.

## Do not

Add a UI library or a second fetch library. Do not write tests unless asked. Do not import backend code.
